<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for reaching out to the Qantas Customer Care team about your recent flight.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
<strong>Things don’t always go to plan</strong><br />
<br />
We want your journey to be as smooth as possible, so I’m sorry to hear about your experience as well as the difficulties you dealt with when arriving at {{{Case.Arrival_City__c}}}. I understand how upsetting this would’ve been.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
<strong>Contact the local Airport Authority</strong><br />
<br />
Customs and Immigration regulations are determined by the government in {{{Case.Arrival_Country__c}}}, rather than by Qantas, so we’re unable to comment on the decisions made by the officers there. If you’d like to follow this up, you’ll need to contact the local Airport Authority.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience — we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
